{"about_the_game":"We all love a classic shoot-em-up game. Well, here's one for you, Retro Style.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShoot those Aliens with all that you got, but don't go too crazy. Watch out for your fuel level. If you run out of fuel, game over!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuild up your Bonus as you shoot, random bonus awarded as your Bonus hits max.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThose eyeball aliens will strike you and present a strike counter. If the strike counter gets to one, next strike, life gone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMystery triangle hit is rewarded by more Bonus points.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRandom teleport-ed Aliens will appear at intervals, so watch out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you manage to get past Level 14, you're gifted!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy and Good luck.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"04082dbf973c0816966926acfd554caec7673db5.jpg","localized_name":"Level 1 Completed","name":"Level 1 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/967910/04082dbf973c0816966926acfd554caec7673db5.jpg"},{"icon":"58ed201091a1439973b31f7ba700ce9999325220.jpg","localized_name":"Level 2 Completed","name":"Level 2 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/967910/58ed201091a1439973b31f7ba700ce9999325220.jpg"},{"icon":"b155e4d739cdcf8b49fd316faaf95dcebffb3157.jpg","localized_name":"Level 3 Completed","name":"Level 3 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/967910/b155e4d739cdcf8b49fd316faaf95dcebffb3157.jpg"},{"icon":"7c62483991a43c9104e9a045f4f69e5011a50bd8.jpg","localized_name":"Level 4 Completed","name":"Level 4 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/967910/7c62483991a43c9104e9a045f4f69e5011a50bd8.jpg"},{"icon":"4c6eb9feeb815f043dda1fd989bab81abbcb373d.jpg","localized_name":"Level 5 Completed","name":"Level 5 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/967910/4c6e